     * a per-variable narrowing would normally lose: knowing `$x === null` should
     * imply `$y === int`, but `foreach ($a as [$x, $y])` assigns `$x` and `$y`
     * independently, so each ends up as the union (`int|null`) and the link is
     * dropped.
